  "description": {
   "en": "Yokohama is a dangerous town that stinks of filth, located in Hinodecho and Koganecho on the Keihin Kyuko Line. The man calls this area the ends of the earth, and Algeria the Kasba. The man's name is Naojiro. Misako, who works at a department store, is invited by Naojiro, whom she meets here, and begins to see the depths of life... A collection of works depicting the present day of young people living in the postwar era."
